	(text "The pixel nibble data order is:\nOCHA2 and OCHA3: 2,1,0,3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 287.02 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "15087e39-5467-4f56-bb01-5727ed590498")
	)
	(text "dsh0[0] = Q11(16), dsh0[1] = Q10(13)\ndsh1[0] = Q21(17), dsh1[1] = Q20(12)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 408.94 138.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "26e8568a-51de-4e88-8f1d-f138b65adb98")
	)
	(text "Object RAM\n\nByte 0\n\nD[3:0]	color, palette\nD[5:4]	not used\nD6		flipx, inverted in mame, check\nD7		flipy\n\nByte 1\n\nPos y, in mame 16 is added to the value and subtracted from 255.\n\nByte 2\nSprite code\n\nByte 3\n\nPos x, 32 is added to this value unless flipscreen is active\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 86.36 1.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "531ed642-9b09-48f7-97a2-1a618bdb9c10")
	)
	(text "When the corresponding line counter is enabled\n,~{LDCNT1}, the x positions go from 0..15, drawing\nevery pixel of the 16 x 16 sprite object to the\nactive line buffer for drawing. When the line\nbuffer toggles after ~{OHSTART} goes high the \npixels are read and the x positions go from\n0..247"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 227.33 237.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "53b3f739-45ee-42bd-9c1b-56beddd2f21e")
	)
	(text "128 + 64 +32 + 16 = 240\n\n16 x 15 = 240, på en csync period, minus blank\nhinner vcount gå från 16..256, V1,V2,V4,V8 \ngår 16 gånger igenom varje sprite, en för\nvarje rad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 196.85 -7.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5d813d63-befd-4946-bf30-34c7665c0c00")
	)
	(text "It draws 2B = 16bits/(vertical_line x object)\n= 4 pixels / (VL x OBJ)."
